WEBVTT

00:30:59.538 --> 00:31:03.079
The findings that I have looked
at suggests that, yes, right.

00:31:03.079 --> 00:31:05.246
To the extent that people
are less narcissistic,

00:31:05.579 --> 00:31:08.871
they would also manifest in positive
ways in the interpersonal level.

00:31:09.496 --> 00:31:12.746
We can all agree that recessions are
terrible in the short term for

00:31:12.746 --> 00:31:17.371
so many reasons. But in the long term,
having experienced their own struggles,

00:31:17.663 --> 00:31:19.788
leaders in the future may
be less entitled,

00:31:19.996 --> 00:31:22.496
more honest and more caring
toward employees.

00:31:23.288 --> 00:31:26.954
And in the meantime, we all may
be more community focused.

00:31:28.496 --> 00:31:31.496
But during a recession, there's
a darker side to this.